<title>BELGIUM: Ivory Coast cocoa crop 950,000 tonnes  - premier.</title>
<headline>Ivory Coast cocoa crop 950,000 tonnes  - premier.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ivorian Prime Minister Daniel Kablan Duncan said on Thursday he expected the country's cocoa crop to total around 950,000 tonnes in 1996/97 (Oct-Sep), down from a record 1.2 million tonnes last year.</p>
</text>
